[test fallback_grounded]
# gen66: fallback reflection is grounded in KB/self-knowledge.
# It must not claim ignorance of parrot0, which is known through i_am(parrot0),
# and it must use KB stopword facts for supported Italian function words.
> tell me blargle
<~ Hmm, I don't know about blargle yet. Want me to learn about it?
> parrot0 !!!
< I don't understand that yet.
> another blargle
<~ Hmm, I don't know about blargle yet. Want me to learn about it?
> ma stai scherzando?
< Non capisco ancora.

